{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v5.json",
  "description": "Zoomable sunburst using exactly the 4,034 observations for the 10 species embedded in DotMap.vg.json. Broad mammal group → taxonomic order → species. Species counts are aggregated directly from DotMap observations, including its coordinate and species selection. Higher taxonomy matched by genus to the Mammal Diversity Database, https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mammaldiversity/mammaldiversity.github.io/master/_data/mdd.csv (retrieved 2026-10-10); input scientific names retained. Internal counts are zero to avoid double counting. Counts reflect recording activity, not animal abundance. Click groups or orders to focus; click centre to return to parent; Escape resets. All data embedded. Species leaves use the shared BumpChart species colours; internal rings retain broad-group colours. Uses the 10 most recent available observation years (2017–2026), including partial 2026.",
  "width": 960,
  "height": 680,
  "padding": 16,
  "background": "#f7fafc",
  "title": {
    "text": "How Are Mammal Observations Distributed?",
    "subtitle": [
      "Broad groups → taxonomic orders → species",
      "2017–2026 · 4,034 observations · 10 selected species · Click a group or order to zoom · Click centre to go back"
    ],
    "anchor": "start",
    "fontSize": 22,
    "color": "#243447",
    "subtitleFontSize": 12,
    "subtitleColor": "#52606d",
    "offset": 16,
    "subtitlePadding": 6,
    "subtitleLineHeight": 16
  },
  "signals": [
    {
      "name": "focus",
      "value": "all",
      "on": [
        {
          "events": "@segments:click, @childLabels:click",
          "update": "datum.children > 0 ? datum.id : focus"
        },
        {
          "events": "@centre:click",
          "update": "focus === 'all' ? 'all' : data('focusNode')[0].parent"
        },
        {
          "events": "view:keydown[event.key === 'Escape']",
          "update": "'all'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hovered",
      "value": null,
      "on": [
        {
          "events": "@segments:mouseover, @childLabels:mouseover",
          "update": "datum.id"
        },
        {
          "events": "@segments:mouseout, @childLabels:mouseout",
          "update": "null"
        },
        {
          "events": {
            "signal": "focus"
          },
          "update": "null"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "current",
      "update": "data('focusNode')[0]"
    },
    {
      "name": "hole",
      "value": 72
    },
    {
      "name": "radius",
      "value": 275
    },
    {
      "name": "ring",
      "update": "(radius - hole) / (3 - current.depth)"
    },
    {
      "name": "detail",
      "update": "hovered ? data('hoverNode')[0] : current"
    }
  ],
